<troubleshooting id="troubleshooting-3886" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic troubleshooting/troubleshooting "><title class="- topic/title ">Why can't I add users?</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Learn why the option to add users in MyGeotab is unavailable.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><author translate="no" type="creator" class="- topic/author ">Example Author &lt;author@example.com&gt;</author><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><keyword class="- topic/keyword "></keyword><keyword class="- topic/keyword "></keyword><keyword class="- topic/keyword "></keyword></keywords><prodinfo class="- topic/prodinfo "><prodname class="- topic/prodname "/><vrmlist class="- topic/vrmlist "><vrm modification="" release="" version="" class="- topic/vrm "/></vrmlist></prodinfo></metadata></prolog><troublebody class="- topic/body troubleshooting/troublebody "><condition class="- topic/section troubleshooting/condition "><p class="- topic/p ">When you navigate to the Users and Driver page, the option to add a user is unavailable. This means that your account doesn't have the necessary security clearances to add users.</p></condition><troubleSolution class="- topic/bodydiv troubleshooting/troubleSolution "><cause class="- topic/section troubleshooting/cause "><p class="- topic/p ">Contact an Administrator with full database access to adjust your security clearances. To add users, you must have the following clearances:</p><p class="- topic/p "><ul class="- topic/ul "><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">Administer Users/Drivers</p></li><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">List Users/Drivers</p></li></ul></p></cause></troubleSolution></troublebody></troubleshooting>